  <name>UseImportOfGoodsFromCustomsUnionGoodsInTransit</name>
  <synonym>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Use import of goods from the Customs Union (goods in transit)</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>استفاده از واردات کالا از اتحادیه گمرکی (کالاهای در راه)</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Usare importazione di merci dall'unione doganale (merci in transito)</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Używaj wwóz towarów z Unii Celnej (wiersze pozycji w drodze)</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Использовать ввоз товаров из таможенного союза (товары в пути)</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Gümrük birliğinden ürün ithalatını kullan (transit mallar)</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Sử dụng nhập khẩu hàng hóa từ liên minh hải quan (hàng hóa quá cảnh)</value>
  </synonym>
  <location>Constant.UseImportOfGoodsFromCustomsUnionGoodsInTransit</location>
  <privilegedGetMode>true</privilegedGetMode>
</mdclass:FunctionalOption>
